What it is
A social network, a photo library and a NAS, in one device
One small device in your home keeps your family's posts, photos and files. Apps on every platform keep it in sync and let you browse, search and share it.
💬
Your own social network
Post photos and videos for your family and friends, with captions, comments, likes and notifications. Only the friends you've accepted see them, newest first: no ads, no influencers and no algorithm deciding what you see.
🏡
No company in the middle
Every family's posts live on its own device, and friends' devices fetch them from each other. There's no central server holding everyone's photos, so there's nothing to sell, mine or leak in one place.
📸
Every photo, backed up
The phone apps back up every photo and video in the background, as the original, so your library is complete and in full quality, with no storage plan to outgrow.
🗂️
A NAS for your files
Keep folders from every computer in two-way sync or backed up, open and share them from your phone, and lock a folder so nothing in it can be deleted and earlier versions are kept.
🔍
AI search, kept private
Every photo is auto-tagged locally on the device, so you can search "beach" or "dog" instantly — nothing is sent to a third party to do it.
👨‍👩‍👧
One device, the whole family
Give everyone at home their own account on the same device — their own photo backup, library and password, each encrypted with its own key. You manage the accounts, but you can't open the photos and files in them.
🔗
Share collections with a link
Send a collection of photos to anyone as a link that expires. They open it in their browser, with no account or app, and can download the originals.
⚡
Fast at home
At home the apps talk straight to the device over your own network, so a whole holiday's photos back up at Wi-Fi speed instead of crawling over the internet.
💾
The device
A Raspberry Pi 5 with a microSD card for the system and two USB drives mirrored in RAID-1, storing your originals exactly as they arrive, never resized or recompressed — encrypted at rest, with a key that only your password unlocks.
📱
Mobile app
iOS and Android apps for your social feed, notifications and photo backup: they back up your camera roll in the background, in full resolution.
🖥️
Desktop client
macOS, Windows and Linux apps that keep chosen folders on your computer in two-way sync with the device, automatically.
🌐
Web app
Everything above, from any browser — sign in with just your password, no app install required.
